**Profile**: Title: Fagaceae Peninsula, Origin: Rinascita.

{{Intro/Location|Fagaceae Peninsula}} This peninsula thick with oak trees was once where Rinascita's rulers gathered for secret councils. The Oracles carved into the stone and trees have withstood the passage of time, though their messages are now nearly impossible to distinguish.

